    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Built for war. Modified by you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vessel, you take control of a customizable combat mech and face off in brutal one-on-one battles where every choice matters\u2014from your loadout to how you fight. Vessel is a third person fighting game with armor destruction system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through enemy armor, manage system damage, and exploit weaknesses in dynamic arenas. Powered by detailed destruction and full character customization, no two fights play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your build. Adapt on the fly. Win by any means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Built for war. Modified by you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vessel, you take control of a customizable combat mech and face off in brutal one-on-one battles where every choice matters\u2014from your loadout to how you fight. Vessel is a third person fighting game with armor destruction system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through enemy armor, manage system damage, and exploit weaknesses in dynamic arenas. Powered by detailed destruction and full character customization, no two fights play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your build. Adapt on the fly. Win by any means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
